# What TopoText builds on, each at a commit: the only place these are
# named. ci.yml, release.yml (gnustep-release-actions' pins action) and the
# Dockerfiles read this file. To move one, change it here.

# ODataKit: TopoTextSync builds against its ODataSync.
ODATAKIT_REF=de46fce3540bd20ddb36907c869f526aa4f96db1

# gnustep-patches, the patched GNUstep stack. 4d5599f: NSExpression's
# FUNCTION and FETCH, and an expression given for %@ taken as that
# expression, which FreeCoreData's migrations need. c03ea57 (with
# FreeCoreData 5b83123, #68): fetch indexes; a nil constant in a predicate
# prints, and parses back, as nil. edc2289: a nil argument for %@ compares
# with nil. 40a2bc8: keep-nib-textfield-bezel retired, merged into Eau's
# dev. 4593e60: Eau built at a pinned commit of dev (01be00b). 239a625:
# NSDictionary and NSArray read a binary property list from a file.
# 1eda55d, 6d99b7c, d7eccc9, 610d60b, 43dcb1f: fixes retired as libs-base
# merged them (its master is built). fb112b4 (#8): NSCollectionView makes
# its items and lays them out in lines. 8fa1baf (#10): a character a font
# lacks is given a font by name (menus' ⌘ ⇧ ⌥ drawn, and opening fast with
# many fonts installed); a double click on an attachment reaches the text
# view's delegate (a file attachment opens). dcbad8f (#11): a divider
# moved by -setPosition:ofDividerAtIndex: is told of (the panes' widths
# kept). 7adc606 (#12): libs-base moved (#843 merged, predicate-secure-coding
# rebased; the stack builds from scratch again), and arc4random() and its
# companions on glibc before 2.36.
# 60de7bc (#14): libs-base merged #847 (plist-read-binary leaves) and moved
# past it, which had stopped every build of the stack from scratch;
# libs-gui merged #984 (xib-date-picker left, #13).
GNUSTEP_PATCHES_REF=60de7bcc1ce7744581acffdc5cd3f97512af19d1

# FreeCoreData, Core Data on GNUstep. f3d56b4 (#62-67): momc reads Preserve
# After Deletion and Renaming IDs as Xcode writes them; a store comes
# through a migration as the same store, metadata and history; an inferred
# mapping follows Renaming IDs. 591dfa6 (#69): a model's copy keeps exactly
# its indexes. fd6ae53 (#70): -migratePersistentStore: (the server's
# MoveFrom). 338bc7b (#71) and eaf7072 (#72): objects and contexts let go
# of what they held (the server's memory). 5247095 (#73): objects tell
# their context of their changes (no KVO), and a fetch reads its rows at
# once. 5bfd5a8 (#76): a context made off the main thread is not driven
# from the main run loop.
FREECOREDATA_REF=5bfd5a87179cff43e0a8a55622fc00f01951c88a
